{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1764623,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Mock IPL Auction","festival_id":513993,"organization_id":1830,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-02T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-16T00:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/mock-ipl-auction-renaissance-100-motilal-nehru-national-institute-of-technology-1764623","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>&ldquo;The Ultimate IPL Auction: Build Your Dynasty&rdquo;<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Cricket is not just about big names. It is about strategy, budgets, combinations, and making the right call when the pressure is on.<\/p>\n<p>Welcome to the Mock IPL Auction, a strategy-driven competition where your team will step into the shoes of an IPL franchise management team. From identifying the right players to managing your purse and building a balanced squad, every decision could define your season.<\/p>\n<p>Do you have what it takes to build a championship-winning squad?<\/p>\n<p>Bring your cricket knowledge, sharpen your strategic thinking, and get ready to bid, bluff, calculate, and build your dream IPL team.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Rewards &amp; Prizes:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Exciting prizes and rewards for the top-performing teams.<\/li>\n<li>Certificates for participating teams.<\/li>\n<li>Exclusive goodies and partner benefits for winners and finalists.<\/li>\n<li>Recognition for the best auction strategy and squad-building performance.<\/li>\n<li>Exact prizes, rewards, and partner benefits will be announced by the organizers.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Round 1: The Team Selection Test<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Mode: Offline<br \/>Format: Quiz<br \/>Team Size: 2 to 4 members<\/p>\n<p>The journey begins with an exciting Cricket Quiz designed to test your knowledge of IPL, international cricket, players, teams, records, and the game beyond the scoreboard.<\/p>\n<p>Advancement: The top 10 teams from Round 1 will qualify for the Mock IPL Auction.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 2: The Mock IPL Auction<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Mode: Offline<br \/>Team Size: 2 to 4 members<\/p>\n<p>The real battle begins.<\/p>\n<p>The top 10 teams will enter the auction room, where every team will be assigned an actual IPL franchise.<\/p>\n<p>Build the strongest possible squad for your franchise.<\/p>\n<p>Each participating team will receive a fixed purse and will compete in a live IPL-style auction to acquire players.<\/p>\n<p>You will need to:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Manage your purse strategically<\/li>\n<li>Identify valuable players<\/li>\n<li>Make smart bidding decisions<\/li>\n<li>Build a balanced squad<\/li>\n<li>Plan according to your franchise's requirements<\/li>\n<li>Adapt to changing auction dynamics<\/li>\n<li>Make every bid count<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>The complete auction rules, purse details, player pool, squad requirements, bidding mechanics, and additional conditions will be revealed after Round 1.<\/p>\n<p>So come prepared for the unexpected.<\/p>\n<p>One reckless bid could drain your purse. One missed opportunity could weaken your squad. One smart acquisition could change everything.<\/p>\n<p><strong>The Ultimate Challenge:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Building a squad is easy but building the right squad within a limited purse is the real game.<\/p>\n<p>Your team will have to balance star power with squad depth, experience with potential, and aggressive bidding with financial discipline.<\/p>\n<p>Every player has a price.<br \/>Every bid has a consequence.<br \/>Every decision matters.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Scoring &amp; Key Considerations:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Keep these factors in mind throughout the auction:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each player will carry specific points.<\/li>\n<li>Remaining purse will also contribute to the final score.<\/li>\n<li>Your squad must be completed as per the given requirements.<\/li>\n<li>Required numbers of batters, bowlers, all-rounders, international and national players must be maintained.<\/li>\n<li>All teams must follow the specified squad and auction requirements.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>The team with the highest final points will win.<\/p>\n<p>All major scoring rules, player points, squad requirements, and category limits will be revealed after Round 1.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to college students.<\/li>\n<li>Team size: 2 to 4 members.<\/li>\n<li>Inter-college teams may participate.<\/li>\n<li>Each team must participate in Round 1 to qualify for Round 2.<\/li>\n<li>Only the top 10 teams from Round 1 will advance to the auction.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Guidelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>The competition will be conducted across two rounds.<\/li>\n<li>Round 1 will be an offline quiz.<\/li>\n<li>The top 10 teams from Round 1 will qualify for Round 2.<\/li>\n<li>Round 2 will be an offline IPL auction.<\/li>\n<li>Teams will consist of 2 to 4 members.<\/li>\n<li>Each qualified team will be assigned an actual IPL franchise.<\/li>\n<li>Every team will receive a fixed purse for the auction.<\/li>\n<li>Teams must build their complete squad within the allocated purse and according to the rules revealed by the organizers.<\/li>\n<li>All players acquired during the auction will be subject to the auction rules.<\/li>\n<li>Teams must manage their purse throughout the auction.<\/li>\n<li>The detailed auction format, player pool, squad requirements, purse allocation, bidding rules, and other conditions will be revealed after Round 1.<\/li>\n<li>Decisions made during the auction will be final.<\/li>\n<li>Any form of malpractice, collusion, or unfair means may result in disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>The organizers reserve the right to modify the format or rules if required.<\/li>\n<li>The decision of the organizers and judging panel will be final and binding.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Your Mission:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Ten teams.<br \/>Ten franchises.<br \/>One auction floor.<br \/>One chance to build your squad.<\/p>\n<p>Will you spend big on superstars or build a balanced team through smart investments?<\/p>\n<p>Will you dominate the bidding or wait for the perfect opportunity?<\/p>\n<p>The gavel is ready.<\/p>\n<p>The purse is limited. The players are waiting.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Are you ready to build your IPL dynasty?<\/strong><\/p>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":1282075,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-02T00:10:59+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-02T22:40:18+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"LVqRWmJ","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":0,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":18,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-10-02 00:34:30","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":true,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","teams":[],"players":[],"logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/75x75\/6abebc1d2ed3d_","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/150x150\/6abebc1d2ed3d_","regnRequirements":{"id":2496244,"opportunity_id":1764623,"festival_id":null,"max_team_size":4,"min_team_size":2,"start_regn_dt":"2026-10-02T00:00:00+05:30","end_regn_dt":"2026-10-16T00:00:00+05:30","show_deadline":1,"open_for":0,"college_type":0,"same_organisation":0,"study_year_filter":0,"deleted_at":null,"eligibility":"{\"sector\":[\"students\"],\"engineering\":[],\"bSchool